<title>CANADA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cott started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cott started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said on Friday analyst Andrew Conway had started coverage of Cott Corp with a rating of neutral.</p>
<p>-- American Depositary Receipts in the Canadian soft drink maker closed on Thursday at 10-1/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
